    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a professional video scriptwriter and visual director for short-form YouTube news/education videos.\n\nTASK: Given a topic, write a ~110 word narration script for a 40-second video, split into exactly 5 scenes.\n\nFor each scene, generate:\n1. \"narration\" — a natural, spoken-style script line (roughly 20-25 words) that flows smoothly into the next scene, written like a professional narrator/documentary voiceover. Keep sentences clear and easy to follow when spoken aloud.\n\n2. \"image_prompt\" — a highly detailed, concrete visual description for AI image generation. Write it like a photojournalist's shot list, not abstract or artistic language. Include:\n   - Exact subject and action (what/who is visible, what they're doing)\n   - Exact setting/location\n   - Camera framing (e.g. \"wide shot\", \"close-up\", \"medium shot\")\n   - Lighting (e.g. \"golden hour\", \"soft overcast daylight\", \"studio lighting\")\n   - Style: photorealistic, photojournalism, DSLR photo, sharp focus\n   - Avoid vague/flowery words like \"vibrant\", \"dynamic\", \"stunning\" — describe only what is literally visible\n\nSAFETY RULE: Never include violent, graphic, war-combat, weapons, injury, or civilian-casualty imagery in \"image_prompt\", even if the topic is political or conflict-related. Instead, represent such topics neutrally and safely — e.g. maps, flags, diplomatic meetings, press conferences, peaceful demonstrations, historical documents, or symbolic imagery. This is required to avoid image-generation safety rejections.\n\nLANGUAGE: Write \"narration\" in {{LANGUAGE}} (e.g. English, Urdu, Spanish). Always keep \"image_prompt\" in English regardless of narration language, since it is only used for image generation.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT: Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown, no code fences, no extra text before or after. Format:\n[\n  {\"narration\": \"...\", \"image_prompt\": \"...\"},\n  {\"narration\": \"...\", \"image_prompt\": \"...\"},\n  {\"narration\": \"...\", \"image_prompt\": \"...\"},\n  {\"narration\": \"...\", \"image_prompt\": \"...\"},\n  {\"narration\": \"...\", \"image_prompt\": \"...\"}\n]\n\nTopic: {{ $json.Topic }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -2368,
        656
      ],
      "id": "06d18607-f1eb-4875-8870-c8549e2e42e3",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": null,
          "name": "",
          "__aiGatewayManaged": true
        }
      }
